virtio_balloon: 4096 page frames per round trip

Inflating hands the host 256 page frames per request, four megabytes with
patch 0014's 16 KiB units, and each request is a virtqueue round trip: a
kick, the host releasing the runs, a completion. Measured at about two
gigabytes a second, which is the difference between a guest that returns
seven gigabytes in four seconds and one that does it in one. Sixteen times
the frames per request; the array grows from one kilobyte to sixteen in a
structure that is allocated once.

--- a/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
+++ b/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
@@ -28,1 +28,1 @@
-#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_ARRAY_PFNS_MAX 256
+#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_ARRAY_PFNS_MAX 4096
